      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm seeing some weird small holes appearing on my tomato leaves in the greenhouse. they're tiny, like pinpricks mostly, and it's starting to spread across the whole batch. any idea what might be causing it? i need to figure out if it's a pest or something else asap.",
