      "content": "yeah i'll check for webbing. but it's just so strange... i've got the greenhouse locked up and everything seems totally sealed, yet these holes just keep popping up in these specific little groups while i'm not looking. it feels almost intentional, like something is sneaking in and out in the middle of the night and then just vanishing. is there anything else that can cause damage that wouldn't leave a trace or be easily seen during the day? like something that could just hide in the shadows?",
